      "notes": "Ends 19 August, one day before 3.6. A [Starpath Reverbs] selector runs the full patch alongside the phase banners - one pick from Jiyan, Yinlin, Jinhsi, Changli, Zhezhi or Xiangli Yao. Muyu stands as the arc antagonist heading into 3.6."
