    {
      "id": "3.7",
      "title": "",
      "status": "beta",
      "phases": [],
      "notes": "Drip marketing for Hsin landed on 26 August - Kuro's own card, five stars, no attribute or weapon mark on it - which retires the community's 28-29 August drip projection along with the 4 Sep beta guess the model-rip wave already broke. Hsin is flagged as an Electro Rectifier Sentinel running two switchable stances, now named as Electro Flare and a new Tune Break: Harmony system, plus coordinated attack damage; none of that is on the card. Suoming is the second new Resonator, listed as an Electro Sword on 9 Aug after the same list called her Havoc a week earlier - still contested, and she has no drip card yet. The beta has now opened: a model-rip wave (render, 360, walk/stand/umbrella animations, facial expressions) hit r/WutheringWavesLeaks on 17-18 Aug carrying the subreddit's genuine-beta-capture disclaimer. The rip confirms she's a small Verina/Roccia/Encore-height build but shows no attribute mark or weapon, so it doesn't settle the Havoc-vs-Electro question. Community arithmetic on past patch lengths projects broadcast 18 Sep, Phase 1 2 Oct and Phase 2 24 Oct; none of that is from Kuro."
    }
